      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I scavenged this core from the body of golem in the northmost part of
    the cave, right after the river. It pulses like a heart, if it isn\u2019t one.
    it\u2019s perfectly round and glowing, like a psychic\u2019s orb.\r\nThe moss
    that grows on it tastes like moss, nothing weird here.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
