  m_text: "In the north-half of the forest, Oceania-Cascadyn Trees grow a really
    thin and flexible bark, like rubber. Although it\u2019s very funny to play with,
    it\u2019s impossible to tear it off, and you need to cut it with a knife, or
    scisors."
