      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I Found it in old tree stumps all over the forest. Master once said it\u2019s
    \u201Cattuned to the wind\u201D or whatever. I just know it bites if you\u2019re
    not careful. Still, It\u2019s much easier to feed on something that can\u2019t
    scream."
