  m_text: "If you hang out close to the cave up-north, you\u2019ll find Air Willowraiths.
    Those pesky little spirit things make you sneeze whenever you\u2019re around.
    Even harvesting their dust might give you feverish sneezes. Or maybe I\u2019m
    just allergic."
