      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Down towards the dirt path of the forest may appear Fire Willowraith.
    Those wispy beings wear the skull of wild animals on their head. I hope they
    scavenged it, and didn\u2019t hunt it themselves, I especially don\u2019t want
    my head on those.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
