  m_text: "Just at the entry of the forest, you\u2019ll find many green slimes. They\u2019re
    not aggressive unless you attack them- or is it just a natural response of their
    body? They don\u2019t even have brains, so I\u2019m not even sure they\u2019re
    sentient enough to understand anything.\r"
